{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:d759d0449434ca4c","name":"Baktoid Combat Automata","source":{"id":"source:reference-d759d0449434ca4c","title":"Baktoid Combat Automata","revision":24484,"timestamp":"2024-11-03T15:21:26Z","sha256":"60d70251e21702442717c225a813b8f6284532cf31375658f0e72bf3b2f68f6b","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=24484","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Baktoid%20Combat%20Automata&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-d759d0449434ca4c","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scavenger's Guide to Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scavenger%27s_Guide_to_Droids"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Baktoid Combat Automata is part of the extensive Baktoid family of companies. In factories scattered across the galaxy, Baktoid builds untold numbers of Battle Droids in the years prior to and during ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Clone Wars"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Clone_Wars"},", supplying ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droids","referenceId":"reference:6e72e583603b9ea8"}," to ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Trade Federation"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Trade_Federation","referenceId":"reference:fb5a14e3938c63ab"}," and to ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Confederacy of Independent Systems"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Confederacy_of_Independent_Systems","referenceId":"reference:dfc46c9d666b9b41"},". Baktoid earns a reputation for producing cheap, substandard Battle Droids thanks to its inferior ",{"tag":"a","children":["B1-Series Battle Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/B1-Series_Battle_Droid","referenceId":"reference:5ba341819ad43604"}," unit. Other models lack the B1's flaws, but Baktoid's standard designs still suffer from lesser processors and inhibited analytical thinking. After the Confederacy's defeat, the Empire shuts down Baktoid. Most of its factories are dismantled, destroyed, nationalized, or taken over by other companies. \n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Manufacturer Traits:"]}," Baktoid units suffer from inferior processors and remote data links. A character can make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Persuasion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persuasion","referenceId":"reference:196fbdc5f1823320"}," check opposed by a Baktoid Droid's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," Skill to attempt to temporarily confuse it with contradictory data or brash, seemingly illogical action. If the check is successful, the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," can take no ",{"tag":"a","children":["Actions"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Actions","referenceId":"reference:ff8059dc6752afdd"}," for one round as it tries to find an appropriate response. If the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Persuasion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persuasion","referenceId":"reference:196fbdc5f1823320"}," check is unsuccessful, the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," recognizes the ruse and proclaims it loudly while taking an immediate ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"}," as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reaction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reaction"},".\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
